    f                     -> number of floors
    n (per floor)         -> slots per floor
    q                     -> number of operations

    Commands:
    PARK vehicleNumber
    UNPARK ticketId

Sample Input
    2
    2
    3
    5
    PARK DL01
    PARK DL02
    PARK DL03
    UNPARK T1
    PARK DL04

